{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000028068","bookName":"¿Dónde estás, hija mía?","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000028068/42000028068.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":144495,"followCount":7477,"introduction":"Quince años antes de convertirse en la persona más rica de Jaide, Juana Yebra vio cómo unos traficantes se llevaban a su hija, Violeta Jurado. Ahora, viaja a Dalevista en busca de ella, quien fue vendida a Francisco Cruz como futura esposa de su hijo. Violeta escapa de las montañas y se encuentra con Juana, pero antes de reunirse, Sofía Cruz, hija de Francisco, se hace pasar por Violeta y ocupa su lugar como hija de Juana.","chapterCount":64,"labels":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"typeTwoIds":[703],"typeTwoNames":["Familia"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":703,"name":"Familia","replaceName":"familia"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Familia","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"¿Dónde-estás-hija-mía","bookNameLower":"¿dónde-estás-hija-mía","shelfTime":"2026-09-21 00:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-09-21 00:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"20783","performerName":"Qianyun Diao","performerFormatName":"Qianyun-Diao","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/3x8/20783/20783.jpg?time=1789549526630","videoCount":1},{"performerId":"20782","performerName":"Shanzi Yang","performerFormatName":"Shanzi-Yang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/2x8/20782/20782.jpg?time=1791439738619","videoCount":3}],"performerIdList":[20782,20783]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701639445","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/54/8x6/86x0/860x8/86082000024/701639445_1/701639445.720p.wz.h264.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=ZyMyMemNe4ufaL8n1hSQS69q5mYUmbVqNFsikxYqqUxi~dkqzPLq0sdFdzI6LywPXSAy6EVHdyTGadNKzGzkraUWAK8eQKM~pzViZAuHmR3W42JcbtEMoip-yBYmOjhO~YCiAMKQVIY3h9CfaRP9BHTplSc7aGPhDU5b3z2f920D~DTXnKdb7Zf1vFJfSDAQkrOSQOnHj9I2WmdYNIy